  Lead usage/confidence balance
  Tune Lead oversight; Worker effort and required checks stay unchanged.

  1. Maximum savings                       Use the fewest practical optional Lead oversight
                                           checkpoints and reuse existing evidence.
  2. Usage efficient                       Use targeted Lead oversight where it can prevent likely
                                           rework.
› 3. Current behavior (default) (current)  Keep today's discretionary Lead oversight behavior
                                           unchanged.
  4. Confidence focused                    Independently check important assumptions and risky
                                           decisions.
  5. Maximum confidence                    Examine plausible failure modes and cross-check
                                           consequential results.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
